# `🔬 ENGINEERING PHILOSOPHY`

```text
01. Understand the system.

02. Reduce the problem.

03. Find the fundamental constraint.

04. Build from first principles.

05. Measure.

06. Break it.

07. Understand the failure.

08. Fix the architecture.

09. Scale the system.

10. Repeat.
```

> **Don't build what you don't understand.**

> **Don't scale what you haven't measured.**

> **Don't add abstractions without reason.**

> **Don't confuse complexity with sophistication.**

> **Build > Talk.**

